WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.367 --> 00:00:03.403
-My first guest
is a Grammy-nominated artist.

00:00:03.403 --> 00:00:05.505
She stars in the movie
"Cinderella,"

00:00:05.505 --> 00:00:09.108
which begins streaming on Amazon
Prime Video next Friday.

00:00:09.108 --> 00:00:11.744
Here is Camila Cabello!

00:00:11.744 --> 00:00:13.780
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:13.780 --> 00:00:15.681
Oh, my good-- Come on, now!

00:00:15.681 --> 00:00:18.084
That's what I'm talking about!

00:00:18.084 --> 00:00:19.752
-What up?
-I love you, pal.

00:00:19.752 --> 00:00:21.320
Thank you for coming back
on the show.

00:00:21.320 --> 00:00:24.223
I appreciate this.
-Oh, thanks for having me.

00:00:24.223 --> 00:00:26.726
I've been having a ball
just watching you guys

00:00:26.726 --> 00:00:28.294
do the Thank You Notes
and stuff.

00:00:28.294 --> 00:00:30.196
-Oh, my gosh. Yes.
-I was LOL'ing.

00:00:30.196 --> 00:00:32.131
-Sorry about that, yeah.
That took a while.

00:00:32.131 --> 00:00:33.700
-And I loved it.

00:00:33.700 --> 00:00:35.434
How are you, man?
Good to see you.

00:00:35.434 --> 00:00:38.771
I mean, I've seen you --
I saw you like two weeks ago.

00:00:38.771 --> 00:00:41.807
-I want you to come on the show
every night. Why not?

00:00:41.807 --> 00:00:44.343
-I'll be part of The Roots.
-Yeah, please, come on.

00:00:44.343 --> 00:00:46.078
We'd love to have you
as part of The Roots.

00:00:46.078 --> 00:00:48.013
You're always welcome.
-Or I could just be like --

00:00:48.013 --> 00:00:50.383
I could be your hype man.
Like, any time you say a joke,

00:00:50.383 --> 00:00:52.118
I will be like, "Yeah. Right?"

00:00:52.118 --> 00:00:54.854
-I will take that, by the way,
and use that,

00:00:54.854 --> 00:00:56.322
even you just going,
"Yeah. Right?"

00:00:56.322 --> 00:00:57.990
And they'll add it
through the whole show.

00:00:57.990 --> 00:01:00.793
-Just like a button.
-Yeah, I want you --

00:01:00.793 --> 00:01:03.162
I know we're
kind of best friends.

00:01:03.162 --> 00:01:04.497
So I want to --
-For sure.

00:01:04.497 --> 00:01:05.731
-Yeah. I want you to know --

00:01:05.731 --> 00:01:07.567
I want you to clear
something up for me

00:01:07.567 --> 00:01:09.602
because there's all sorts
of rumors flying around.

00:01:09.602 --> 00:01:12.171
You did this TikTok video, okay?

00:01:12.171 --> 00:01:14.440
And there you are.
-I do TikToks nowadays, yep.

00:01:14.440 --> 00:01:16.409
-Yes, and it was
a giant TikTok thing.

00:01:16.409 --> 00:01:20.680
But then look here. Looks like
there's a ring on that finger.

00:01:20.680 --> 00:01:21.814
[ Audience oohs ]

00:01:21.814 --> 00:01:23.816
-Ooh. Is this news?

00:01:23.816 --> 00:01:25.485
And this is --
-No, guys.

00:01:25.485 --> 00:01:27.319
[ Laughter ]

00:01:27.319 --> 00:01:29.488
Sorry. I cut you off.

00:01:29.488 --> 00:01:31.357
-Wait. But that's it?
-Hand it over to you.

00:01:31.357 --> 00:01:33.927
-You know what I'm going to ask?
-I know what you're gonna ask.

00:01:33.927 --> 00:01:36.896
-Did Shawn Mendes
ask to you marry him?

00:01:36.896 --> 00:01:41.400
-Um, he has not.
And I am not engaged.

00:01:41.400 --> 00:01:44.837
I actually -- I just don't --
I still -- I swear to God,

00:01:44.837 --> 00:01:48.107
I don't know what hand
the engagement ring goes on,

00:01:48.107 --> 00:01:50.710
so sometimes I'll just, like,
put it on my ring finger.

00:01:50.710 --> 00:01:52.812
And, I mean, I'd actually
like you to enlighten me.

00:01:52.812 --> 00:01:54.680
Which hand is
the engagement hand?

00:01:54.680 --> 00:01:56.082
'Cause I don't know.

00:01:56.082 --> 00:01:59.118
My parents are married,
and they both lost their ring.

00:01:59.118 --> 00:02:03.189
And so, literally, like,
my mom couldn't tell me either.

00:02:03.189 --> 00:02:04.957
Like, she could
save me from this,

00:02:04.957 --> 00:02:06.625
but she doesn't because
she doesn't know either.

00:02:06.625 --> 00:02:10.796
-Yeah. It's the left.
It's the left hand. Right? Yeah.

00:02:10.796 --> 00:02:13.099
-You don't even know! See?

00:02:13.099 --> 00:02:15.568
Is this common knowledge?
-No, it's common knowledge.

00:02:15.568 --> 00:02:18.404
But I'm trying to remember.
But when you do the wedding --

00:02:18.404 --> 00:02:21.474
-Nah, you sound insecure
about this.

00:02:21.474 --> 00:02:25.211
-Well, I almost ripped my finger
off with my wedding ring.

00:02:25.211 --> 00:02:28.314
That's --
-So you don't wear yours either?

00:02:28.314 --> 00:02:32.285
-No, I just -- I have
a tattoo on my lower back.

00:02:32.285 --> 00:02:33.686
[ Laughter ]

00:02:33.686 --> 00:02:35.821
-Hot.
-That says "Married." "Taken."

00:02:35.821 --> 00:02:38.090
-Says her name.
-It says "Taken," yeah.

00:02:38.090 --> 00:02:39.759
-I have a tattoo of Shawn
on my lower back, too.

00:02:39.759 --> 00:02:43.562
Wait. We have the same tattoo.
Yeah. We have the same tattoo.

00:02:43.562 --> 00:02:46.633
-It says -- It says, "Señor,"
and he has one of his

00:02:46.633 --> 00:02:49.669
lower back that says "Señorita."

00:02:49.669 --> 00:02:53.172
-Shawn was on our show.
Tell him we said hello.

00:02:53.172 --> 00:02:56.643
He was nice enough to come
on our show early in quarantine.

00:02:56.643 --> 00:02:58.911
I want to talk to you
about "Cinderella."

00:02:58.911 --> 00:03:02.247
This is giant.
You are Cinderella.

00:03:02.247 --> 00:03:03.783
-It's crazy.
-How does it feel?

00:03:03.783 --> 00:03:05.384
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:03:05.384 --> 00:03:08.021
-I mean, it's incredible.
You said it.

00:03:08.021 --> 00:03:09.789
Like, it's just incredible.

00:03:09.789 --> 00:03:14.127
I was in this kind of new
bad-ass version

00:03:14.127 --> 00:03:16.129
of this kind of classic
fairy tale,

00:03:16.129 --> 00:03:18.831
but it's told
in a totally different way.

00:03:18.831 --> 00:03:22.001
And Cinderella is just, like,
a bad ass in this one.

00:03:22.001 --> 00:03:25.237
And, you know, she's not waiting
for a prince to save her.

00:03:25.237 --> 00:03:26.539
She's saving herself.

00:03:26.539 --> 00:03:27.973
-Yeah.
-You know.

00:03:27.973 --> 00:03:29.609
-Oh, I like that.

00:03:29.609 --> 00:03:32.712
-And I feel like those
are the princess values.

00:03:32.712 --> 00:03:34.680
Like, I feel like
the whole fairy-tale values

00:03:34.680 --> 00:03:37.683
need to be rewritten for 2021,

00:03:37.683 --> 00:03:42.321
and that is what Kay Cannon,
our fabulous director, did.

00:03:42.321 --> 00:03:47.226
She just, like, rewrote it
for young people now.

00:03:47.226 --> 00:03:49.462
So, yeah, it's very sick.

00:03:49.462 --> 00:03:51.764
-Well, it's an awesome cast.

00:03:51.764 --> 00:03:55.168
Idina Menzel, Pierce Brosnan,
Minnie Driver.

00:03:55.168 --> 00:03:58.004
But my favorite,
besides you, of course,

00:03:58.004 --> 00:04:01.440
is the Fairy Godmother --
is played by Billy Porter.

00:04:01.440 --> 00:04:03.376
-Oh, yes.
-I loved it. It's so --

00:04:03.376 --> 00:04:04.977
-Oh, my God, yeah.

00:04:04.977 --> 00:04:06.712
And, like, in this version --
So there's, like,

00:04:06.712 --> 00:04:11.417
the Fairy Godmother, and
he is the "Fabulous Godmutha."

00:04:11.417 --> 00:04:13.018
[ Laughter ]

00:04:13.018 --> 00:04:14.453
Which is how he says it.

00:04:14.453 --> 00:04:15.854
-That's how he says it, yeah.
-And --

00:04:15.854 --> 00:04:17.156
-How is he?
-Yeah, he'll be like,

00:04:17.156 --> 00:04:19.725
"I'm your fabulous Godmutha."

00:04:19.725 --> 00:04:23.629
-Yeah. How was he to work with?

00:04:23.629 --> 00:04:25.130
-Oh, my God. He was incredible.

00:04:25.130 --> 00:04:27.499
I mean, I was really nervous
when I first met him.

00:04:27.499 --> 00:04:28.968
I was like, "Oh, my God."

00:04:28.968 --> 00:04:30.336
He just has this, like,

00:04:30.336 --> 00:04:32.771
huge soul, this huge presence,
this huge voice.

00:04:32.771 --> 00:04:36.475
Everything about him
feels so, like, huge, you know.

00:04:36.475 --> 00:04:38.044
And I just like --

00:04:38.044 --> 00:04:40.412
He just immediately was
so disarming, and I was like,

00:04:40.412 --> 00:04:42.115
"I'm, like, so nervous
to meet you.

00:04:42.115 --> 00:04:43.315
Like, I'm such a huge fan."

00:04:43.315 --> 00:04:45.518
And by the end of it,
he was like,

00:04:45.518 --> 00:04:48.154
"Oh, I want to be
your Fab G in real life now.

00:04:48.154 --> 00:04:50.222
Let's hang out."
-I love that.

00:04:50.222 --> 00:04:51.958
-"You know, let's be friends."

00:04:51.958 --> 00:04:53.426
And I feel like --

00:04:53.426 --> 00:04:56.796
You know, my castmate Nick,
who was the Prince,

00:04:56.796 --> 00:04:58.897
was, like, making fun of me
the whole time

00:04:58.897 --> 00:05:00.332
because I feel like --

00:05:00.332 --> 00:05:02.969
The thing that I was most
excited about in the film

00:05:02.969 --> 00:05:05.404
besides the film itself
was just, like, making friends

00:05:05.404 --> 00:05:07.173
and the friendships
and relationships

00:05:07.173 --> 00:05:08.407
that I would get out of it.

00:05:08.407 --> 00:05:11.477
And having a real Fab G,
having Billy Porter

00:05:11.477 --> 00:05:13.646
as my real fabulous godmother --

00:05:13.646 --> 00:05:15.148
-Not too shabby. Yeah.
-Pretty sick.

00:05:15.148 --> 00:05:16.782
-That's pretty great, yeah.
-Pretty sick.

00:05:16.782 --> 00:05:20.787
-I love that you also -- Your
first acting role you chose --

00:05:20.787 --> 00:05:22.989
You go, "Yeah,
I'm gonna be Cinderella."

00:05:22.989 --> 00:05:25.858
Like, that's so cool.
It's perfect. I love it.

00:05:25.858 --> 00:05:28.327
I think it's perfect casting,
and you're great in it.

00:05:28.327 --> 00:05:30.762
Congrats, pal.
I want to show everyone a clip.

00:05:30.762 --> 00:05:33.165
-Thanks so much, bro.
-Here is Camila Cabello

00:05:33.165 --> 00:05:35.367
and Billy Porter
in "Cinderella."

00:05:35.367 --> 00:05:37.003
Take a look at this.

00:05:37.003 --> 00:05:40.072
-[ Gasps, screams, laughs ]

00:05:40.072 --> 00:05:41.740
This is gorgeous!

00:05:41.740 --> 00:05:44.643
-Yas, future Queen! Yas!

00:05:44.643 --> 00:05:46.045
-What's that, Prince?

00:05:46.045 --> 00:05:47.946
[ Gasps ] You'd like to dance?

00:05:47.946 --> 00:05:51.317
Unh-unh-unh!
Get in line, Your Highness.

00:05:51.317 --> 00:05:52.751
-Hold on.

00:05:52.751 --> 00:05:55.621
[ Twinkling ]

00:05:55.621 --> 00:05:57.523
-Where am I going?

00:05:57.523 --> 00:05:59.925
[ Twinkling ]

00:05:59.925 --> 00:06:02.728
[ Gasps ] Wow.

00:06:02.728 --> 00:06:05.164
They're beautiful!

00:06:05.164 --> 00:06:06.766
They're glass?

00:06:06.766 --> 00:06:08.601
Any way you can make them
more comfortable?

00:06:08.601 --> 00:06:10.369
-No.
-But you're magic.

00:06:10.369 --> 00:06:12.438
-Women's shoes are as they are.

00:06:12.438 --> 00:06:14.507
Even magic has its limits.

00:06:14.507 --> 00:06:17.076
-Mnh. True.

00:06:17.076 --> 00:06:18.578
Ow. Ow.

00:06:18.578 --> 00:06:20.012
[ Laughter ]

00:06:20.012 --> 00:06:22.415
-Glass slippers.
Congrats, buddy.

00:06:22.415 --> 00:06:26.219
There's also great music in
this, as well. You're so good.

